OL,3,GNEWSAClosing arguments heard in Sandie
OL,4,APeggie nursing union tribunal
OL,5,
OL,6,FClosing arguments have been heard in
OL,7,Fthe employment tribunal raised by
OL,8,FSandie Peggie against the Royal College
OL,9,Fof Nursing (RCN).
OL,11,FThe Fife nurse has brought the legal
OL,12,Fcase over what she claims was direct
OL,13,Fdiscrimination over her sex-realist
OL,14,Fbeliefs, saying the union had failed to
OL,15,Fadequately support her during a dispute
OL,16,Fwith her employer.
OL,18,FThe RCN denies the claims and insisted
OL,19,Fit acted "reasonably" throughout.
OL,20,FLawyers for the union called for
OL,21,FPeggie's calls to be dismissed.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
